const sourceCode = "# Colors\n\nUse the `fill` prop to change the icon color (defaults to `currentColor`):\n\n```vue\n<Alarm fill=\"#ff0000\" />\n<Alarm fill=\"rgb(0, 128, 255)\" />\n<Alarm fill=\"currentColor\" /> <!-- Inherits text color -->\n```\n\n#### Customizing Duotone Colors\n\n```vue\n<!-- Customizing duotone each layer color and opacity -->\n<Alarm \n  pack=\"duotone\"\n  primaryFill=\"#1E40AF\"\n  :primaryOpacity=\"1\"\n  secondaryFill=\"#3B82F6\"\n  :secondaryOpacity=\"0.4\"\n/>\n\n<!-- Customizing duotone whole svg -->\n<Alarm \n  pack=\"duotone\"\n  fill=\"#3B82F6\"\n  :opacity=\"0.8\"\n/>\n```\n\n### Opacity\n\nControl transparency with the `opacity` prop:\n\n```vue\n<Alarm :opacity=\"0.5\" />\n<Alarm opacity=\"0.75\" />\n```";
